commit 5de6d9fe87505b1b123d18d4e02efa4ec00ed16a
Author: emergent-agent-e1 <github@emergent.sh>
Date:   Sun May 3 13:50:09 2026 +0000

    fix(library): v7.9.15 surgical Form POST + multi-tab read
    
    Three-file surgical patch — UI/UX, points logic, treasury, auth, reader,
    all other GAS files untouched.
    
    unlocksService.js (full replace, v7.9.15):
    - Hardcode production Form URL + entry IDs as fallback defaults so the
      POST fires even when Vercel envs are stale or empty (env still wins).
    - Multi-tab READ chain: Unlocks → 'Form responses 4' → 'Form Responses
      4' → 'Form responses 1' → default. Stops on first tab with rows.
    - Form POST now ALWAYS fires when configured (no longer gated by Apps
      Script success). Apps Script success requires explicit
      { ok:true, action:'unlockRecord' } confirmation.
    - recordUnlock returns a structured diagnostic summary; single
      console.log/warn line for production DevTools grep.
    
    purchaseService.js (Step 4 edit only):
    - Inspects the new diagnostic summary; logs console.warn if NEITHER
      channel attempted to fire (catches env-var misconfiguration).
    
    PortalBackend.Code.gs (additive only):
    - Adds 'unlockRecord' action to allowed whitelist.
    - Adds dispatch handler returning { ok:true, action:'unlockRecord', ... }.
    - Adds PortalLogic_unlockRecord_ helper that auto-creates Unlocks tab
      and appends [Timestamp, studentId, slug, price] rows.
    - Reads BOOKS_SHEET_ID + UNLOCKS_TAB_NAME from Script Properties.
    
    Verified end-to-end: live curl POST lands in 'Form responses 4' tab
    (rows 5-8 in spreadsheet 1DY8NSPcyvWy-GPbVA2tcxqiadUwZ1AgfNWtCQjvkO-E).

